# This repository is mostly binary: a 1996 Macintosh resource fork, the engine
# packs built from it, rendered audio, research PDFs and prebuilt binaries.
# Line-ending conversion would corrupt every one of them, and on the source it
# only makes diffs unreadable -- a 61-line change can be shown as a 1200-line
# rewrite. So it is off for everything.
* -text
